OL,3,GNEWSAHygiene poverty at tipping point,
OL,4,Acharity warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople are increasingly unable to
OL,7,Fafford items they need to feel clean
OL,8,Fand healthy, a charity has warned.
OL,10,FRosemary Ashworth, deputy chief
OL,11,Fexecutive of The Hygiene Bank, told BBC
OL,12,FRadio Surrey the "face" of hygiene
OL,13,Fpoverty had changed and it was
OL,14,Faffecting people who previously felt
OL,15,Ffinancially secure.
OL,17,F"We're at a bit of a tipping point so
OL,18,Fnow feels like the time to do something
OL,19,Fabout it," she said.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
