OL,3,GNEWSAHygiene poverty at tipping point,
OL,4,Acharity warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FJanice Sedgwick, a volunteer at the
OL,7,Fcharity's Guildford branch, said needed
OL,8,Fitems were things like "toothbrushes,
OL,9,Ftoothpaste, shower gel, shampoo,
OL,10,Fsanitary pads and laundry detergent".
